OL,5,G1700 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FPC Martain Anderson pursues a BMW
OL,8,     Fdriving on cloned plates. What do
OL,9,     Fthe driver and passengers have to
OL,10,     Fhide? In Newcastle, a cop tails a
OL,11,     Fcar doing 50mph in a 30.
OL,12,G1800 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FThe interceptors have to drop
OL,14,     Feverything when a speeding 4x4
OL,15,     Frushes past them. The Stanway team
OL,16,     Fpursues a man with a machete.
OL,17,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FA look back at the highlights of
OL,19,     Fthe series, including efforts to
OL,20,     Fcatch a stolen 4x4 that tries to
OL,21,     Frun a police Evo off the road.
