OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FCops seek a car on clone plates
OL,8,     Fthat has racked up nearly 600
OL,9,     Ffines. PC Leslie pulls over a
OL,10,     Fdriver in a car that's not his,
OL,11,     Fwith no insurance and no licence.
OL,12,G2100 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FRich and Ash are after a
OL,14,     Fpotentially armed and dangerous
OL,15,     Fman who's suspected of smashing up
OL,16,     Fa property, and Macca pursues a
OL,17,     Fstolen Ford whose occupants leg it
OL,18,     Finto a field.
